   <section class="sec" id="fitur">
     <div class="wrap">
-      <div class="head"><h2>Features</h2><p class="intro">What AmberLauncher offers.</p></div>
-      <div class="bento"><div class="tile panel t-game"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9L12 3z"/><path d="M12 12l8-4.5M12 12v9M12 12L4 7.5"/></svg><h3>Game</h3><ul><li><b>Separate instances:</b> <span>each instance has its own version, mods, and settings.</span></li><li><b>Vanilla, Fabric (including Legacy Fabric, 1.7.10 to 1.13.2), Forge (1.7.10+), and NeoForge (1.20.2+).</b> <span>Mod and modpack search follows the instance's loader.</span></li><li><b>Bundled Java:</b> <span>Java 8, 17, 21, and 25.</span></li><li><b>Automatic starting values:</b> <span>game RAM, resolution scale, and render distance follow the device's RAM.</span></li><li><b>Renderer choices:</b> <span>Auto, Krypton, MobileGlues, GL4ES, Kopper Zink, and Freedreno (Snapdragon Turnip).</span></li></ul></div><div class="tile panel t-mods"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="13" y="4" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="4" y="13" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16.5 13v7M13 16.5h7"/></svg><h3>Mods and content</h3><ul><li><b>Modrinth and CurseForge</b> <span>right inside the app: mods, modpacks, resource packs, shaders, and datapacks, including their dependencies.</span></li><li><b>Create an instance from a modpack:</b> <span>pick a .mrpack or CurseForge .zip file on the Create Instance screen, and the game and all mods are installed in one go.</span></li><li><b>Manual file installation</b> <span>works too.</span></li></ul></div><div class="tile panel t-ctrl"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 8h10a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v1a3 3 0 0 1-5.2 2L14.5 14h-5l-1.3 1A3 3 0 0 1 3 13v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z"/><path d="M8 10.5v3M6.5 12h3"/><path d="M15.5 11h.01M17.5 13h.01"/></svg><h3>Controls</h3><ul><li><b>Touch control editor:</b> <span>adjust the position, size, and buttons on screen.</span></li><li><b>Bedrock-style touch hotbar:</b> <span>tap the hotbar to select a slot, also with a second finger while the camera is being dragged.</span></li><li><b>Controller (gamepad) support,</b> <span>including mods such as Controlify.</span></li><li><b>Joystick auto-sprint</b> <span>can be turned off, and on-screen Shift/Ctrl/Alt buttons are sent as modifiers.</span></li></ul><div class="rig-slot" id="rig-slot" hidden></div></div><div class="tile panel t-more"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h9M17 7h3M4 17h3M11 17h9"/><circle cx="15" cy="7" r="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="17" r="2"/></svg><h3>More</h3><ul><li><b>Accounts:</b> <span>Microsoft, Ely.by, and offline.</span></li><li><b>Screen recording:</b> <span>choose Game only or With buttons. It saves to the Gallery. Game audio is not recorded yet.</span></li><li><b>Crash reports</b> <span>with optional log upload to mclo.gs.</span></li><li><b>In-app updates,</b> <span>with the 32-bit or 64-bit APK chosen automatically.</span></li><li><b>Interface:</b> <span>Bahasa Indonesia, English, Español, Tiếng Việt, Português (Brasil), and ภาษาไทย.</span></li><li><b>Experimental:</b> <span>TouchController mod support and the Rust engine (Horizon).</span></li></ul></div></div>
+      <div class="head"><h2>Features</h2><p class="intro">AmberLauncher is a fork of Zalith (through NUX Launcher), so most of the hard work is theirs. These are just a few small things added on top, and some of them may not be in other launchers.</p></div>
+      <div class="bento">
+        <div class="tile panel t-look"><h3>Looks</h3><ul><li><b>Two styles:</b> the default dark theme, or Liquid Glass, where panels become frosted glass over your wallpaper (Settings &gt; Display, Android 12 and newer).</li><li><b>Your own wallpaper:</b> an image, a GIF, or a video, with dimming, an accent color, and an ambient glow that follows the picture.</li><li><b>6 languages:</b> Bahasa Indonesia, English, Español, Tiếng Việt, Português (Brasil), and ภาษาไทย.</li></ul></div>
+        <div class="tile panel t-acc"><h3>Accounts</h3><ul><li><b>Microsoft, Ely.by, and offline</b> in one list, with a skin and cape preview.</li><li><b>Works on the Rust engine (Horizon) too:</b> sign in with Microsoft, Ely.by, or an offline account there as well.</li></ul></div>
+        <div class="tile panel t-ctrl"><h3>Controls</h3><ul><li><b>Import layouts from other launchers:</b> files from Zalith, Zalith 2, Pojav, and Mojo are converted to AmberLauncher's format automatically. Layouts can also be saved as presets.</li><li><b>Macros:</b> auto-typed chat or commands, key combos, and turbo clicking on any button.</li><li><b>Touch control editor:</b> adjust position, size, opacity, and buttons. There is a Bedrock-style hotbar and a joystick auto-sprint you can turn off.</li><li><b>Controller (gamepad) support,</b> including mods such as Controlify.</li></ul></div>
+        <div class="tile panel t-game"><h3>Game</h3><ul><li><b>Separate instances</b> with Vanilla, Fabric, Forge, and NeoForge, plus bundled Java 8, 17, 21, and 25.</li><li><b>Renderer choices:</b> Auto, Krypton, MobileGlues, GL4ES, Kopper Zink, and Freedreno (Turnip).</li><li><b>Rust engine (Horizon), still experimental:</b> runs without Java on the versions it supports.</li></ul></div>
+        <div class="tile panel t-mods"><h3>Mods and content</h3><ul><li><b>Modrinth and CurseForge</b> right inside the app: mods, modpacks, resource packs, shaders, and datapacks, including their dependencies.</li><li><b>Create an instance from a modpack</b> (.mrpack or CurseForge .zip) in one go. Installing files manually works too.</li></ul></div>
+        <div class="tile panel t-more"><h3>More</h3><ul><li><b>Screen recording</b> built in: choose Game only or With buttons.</li><li><b>Crash reports</b> with optional log upload to mclo.gs.</li><li><b>In-app updates,</b> with the 32-bit or 64-bit APK chosen automatically.</li><li><b>TouchController mod support</b> (experimental).</li></ul></div>
+      </div>
       <p class="muted">Not supported yet: Forge for Minecraft 1.6.4 and older, NeoForge for 1.20.1 and older, and Quilt.</p>
     </div>
   </section>
